<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>lyrics2emoji</title>
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="${redirect_delay_seconds}; url=https://${cloudfront_domain}/">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://${cloudfront_domain}/">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      background: #1a1a1a;
      color: #eee;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    img { width: min(300px, 80vw); height: auto; }
    p { max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.5; opacity: 0.85; margin: 0; }
    a { color: #9ad6ff; }
  </style>
  <script>setTimeout(() => location.replace("https://${cloudfront_domain}/"), ${redirect_delay_seconds * 1000})</script>
</head>
<body>
  <img src="logo.svg" alt="lyrics2emoji">
  <p>Traducción de letras sincronizadas a pictogramas poéticos, reproducidos en sincronía con la canción para Hydra.</p>
  <p>Redirigiendo a <a href="https://${cloudfront_domain}/">lyrics2emoji</a>…</p>
</body>
</html>
